    <rich_text scale="h2">2. PROJECT OVERVIEW</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
The Student Information System (SIS) is a desktop application developed using C# Windows Forms and MySQL.
The system is designed to help users manage student records, perform database operations, view student information, and organize academic records through a graphical interface.

</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h3">Main Features</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
• User registration and login

• Dashboard with student statistics

• Add, view, edit, and delete student records

• Search students by name or Student ID

• Filter records by year level and program

• Student profile and academic record management

• Subject enrollment and grade management

• General Weighted Average (GWA) calculation

• CSV export

• Input validation

• Exception handling and error logging


</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Implementation Note:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Features listed above have corresponding development work in the repository. Not all features have been retested after the latest integration changes.


</rich_text>
