    <rich_text scale="h2">7. CONCLUSION</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Team SchemaX developed a Student Information System using C# Windows Forms and MySQL.
The project demonstrates collaboration through GitHub, database integration, CRUD development, input validation, exception handling, automated testing, and functional verification.
The 14 planned functional test cases passed during Round 2, and the latest integrated application successfully launched, authenticated a test account, connected to MySQL, and displayed student statistics and existing student records.
Further final-version verification and documentation packaging remain necessary before submission.
