Student database integration was incomplete.
Add, Edit, and Delete testing was blocked.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">October 17 — Integration Retesting:</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Create: PASS
Read: PASS
Update: PASS
Delete: PASS
Search: PASS
Filtering: PASS
The core CRUD operations successfully interacted with the local MySQL database in the tested application version.

</rich_text>
