The CRUD Module provides the student record management operations required by the SchemaX Student Information System.
Testing on October 17 confirmed that Create, Read, Update, and Delete operations worked correctly in the tested application version.
A separate Edit Mode issue was identified and corrected, with final regression verification still pending.
