    <rich_text scale="h2">7. OVERALL TESTING CONCLUSION</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
The SchemaX Student Information System successfully passed build verification and 13 of the 14 recorded functional test cases. Input validation, basic UI behavior, and previously executed error-logging tests produced the expected results.
Source-code investigation identified incomplete Search, CRUD database integration, and application-level exception-handling integration.
The </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">StudentRepository</rich_text>
    <rich_text>, </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">ExceptionHandler</rich_text>
    <rich_text>, and </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">ErrorLog</rich_text>
    <rich_text> components are implemented, but their complete integration with the student form has not yet been verified.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Overall Status:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> PARTIALLY TESTED — FINAL INTEGRATION TESTING PENDING
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Next Action:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Complete the remaining integration work, coordinate with the team, and perform end-to-end testing before final project submission.


