      <rich_text scale="h2">BUG-007: Application Remains in Edit Mode After Deletion</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Date Identified:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> October 17, 2026
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Severity:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Medium
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Status:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> FIX IMPLEMENTED — FINAL REGRESSION TEST PENDING
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Expected Result:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> After successfully deleting a student, the application should return to Add Mode.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Actual Result:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Clicking Add after deletion displayed a message instructing the user to click Edit.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Identified Cause:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> The </rich_text>
      <rich_text family="monospace">_isEdit</rich_text>
      <rich_text> state was not reset after deletion.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Correction Applied:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Added </rich_text>
      <rich_text family="monospace">ExitEditMode();</rich_text>
      <rich_text> inside the </rich_text>
      <rich_text family="monospace">finally</rich_text>
      <rich_text> block of </rich_text>
      <rich_text family="monospace">btnDelete_Click()</rich_text>
      <rich_text>.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Build Result:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> PASS
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Retest Result:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Add Mode validation passed after using Clear Selection. Immediate Add Mode behavior following a successful deletion without using Clear Selection remains to be verified.

</rich_text>
