      <rich_text scale="h3">Database Integration Findings</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
The latest application initially encountered local database configuration and schema compatibility errors.
These included:
◇ MySQL authentication failure

◇ Invalid local appsettings.json structure

◇ Missing users table

◇ Missing user_id column in the students table


Corrections were applied to the local test environment.
The application subsequently connected to MySQL, authenticated the registered test account, displayed dashboard statistics, and retrieved both original student records.

