      <rich_text scale="h2">11. FINAL TESTING CONCLUSION</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
The SchemaX Student Information System underwent two rounds of planned functional testing.
Round 1 identified incomplete database integration and blocked CRUD and Search operations.
Following integration improvements, Round 2 successfully passed all 14 planned functional test cases.
Additional tests also verified searching, filtering, Clear Selection behavior, and CSV export functionality.
During the October 22 integration walkthrough, the latest application successfully built, connected to MySQL, authenticated a registered user, displayed dashboard statistics, and retrieved existing student records after local database compatibility issues were corrected.
The remaining work concerns final-version regression verification, database setup consistency, and documentation completion.
</rich_text>
