    <rich_text scale="h2">11. REMAINING DATABASE WORK</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
1. Confirm the official Student ID format and align application validation with database requirements.

2. Update the final SQL setup script to include the users table and student user_id column.

3. Review account ownership constraints and relationships before final database deployment.

4. Complete the post-deletion Edit Mode regression test.

5. Verify subject enrollment, grades, GWA calculation, and attendance functionality.

6. Complete final regression testing after the latest application integration changes.

7. Ensure local credentials and configuration files are handled securely.



