    <rich_text scale="h2">12. FINAL CONCLUSION</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
The SchemaX Student Information System uses MySQL to store student records, user accounts, subjects, enrollments, and attendance information.
Database-backed student CRUD, Search, and filtering operations passed functional testing on October 17, 2026.
Additional integration testing on October 22 confirmed successful user registration, login, dashboard loading, and student record retrieval after local database configuration and schema issues were resolved.
The latest application demonstrated working integration with the local MySQL database.
Final database script consistency and additional academic-module testing remain necessary before project submission.
