    <rich_text scale="h3">9.3 Important SQL Setup Warning</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">WARNING: Do not execute the database setup script against an existing database without reviewing its contents and creating a backup.</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
The SQL script may contain DROP TABLE statements that remove existing tables and student records.
For an existing installation:
1. Back up the database before making structural changes.

2. Review the SQL script before executing it.

3. Do not rerun destructive database initialization statements merely to repair an application connection.

4. Verify the existing tables and records using MySQL Workbench.


</rich_text>
