</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Edit Mode After Deletion:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> FIX IMPLEMENTED — FINAL REGRESSION TEST PENDING
A state-management issue was identified after deleting a student. The deletion handler was updated to call ExitEditMode(), and the solution built successfully.
Immediate Add Mode behavior following successful deletion, without using Clear Selection, still requires final verification.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Attendance Functionality:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> PENDING INVESTIGATION
The intended behavior and implementation status of the Attendance button require team confirmation.

