    <rich_text scale="h3">12.10 Final Walkthrough Conclusion</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
The October 22 walkthrough confirmed that the latest SchemaX Student Information System successfully launched, connected to MySQL, registered and authenticated a user, loaded dashboard statistics, and retrieved existing student records.
The October 17 testing previously verified core student management features, including CRUD operations, searching, filtering, input validation, and CSV export.
The application demonstrated working core functionality in the tested scenarios.
